<title>HONG KONG: Topstyle interim net loss at HK$9.8 mln.</title>
<headline>Topstyle interim net loss at HK$9.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	  2.58 loss vs 4.03 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)   nil	 vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	 4.41 loss vs 6.48 loss</p>
<p>    Net			   9.79 loss vs 14.16 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		    103.27    vs 129.16</p>
<p>    Company name		Topstyle International Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		 N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	  N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Topstyle International is a silk garment maker. Exceptional loss represents the provision of the slow moving inventory of the &quot;Albantii&quot; label.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
